  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "This amazing rental is only 3.9 miles from the Gulf of Mexico where you will find beautiful turquoise water and fantastic white sandy beaches along the famous Hwy 30A! If you want some calmer waters for kayaking and fishing, it's less than 2 miles to Choctawatchee Bay! The Blue Bayou is a spacious, pet friendly, 4 bedroom, 2 full bath home that can accommodate 10 guests and there is plenty of room for a boat or two!! Relax on the spacious front porch while enjoying your morning coffee, or enjoy a large gathering at night on the back porch screened in bar area, complete with an outdoor TV and furniture ! The interior of the home is light with a relaxing atmosphere and a beautiful wall of glass in the dining room overlooking a large fenced in back yard which is perfect for kids and your pets! There are 6 TV's including one in each bedroom, wireless WI-FI or jump on one of the bikes we provide and to go for a ride! Grab some beach chairs and umbrellas from the garage and watch the sunset! Visit the local restaurants like The Red Bar in Grayton Beach or fresh local Seafood shops and grill outside! Santa Rosa Beach is located between Destin, FL and Panama City Beach, FL. Stop by Grayton Beach State Park and see the amazing sand dunes! There is fantastic shopping in Seaside, Watercolor, Rosemary Beach, Grayton Beach and all along 30-A. Visit the local Dive Shops, or book a fishing charter...there is so much to do! The Blue Bayou is a perfect home away from home for all your family and pets to enjoy!",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
          "title": "PET FRIENDLY BOAT PARKING WHITE SAND BEACHES 30-A. BIKES, BEACH CHAIRS, UMBRELLA"
        }
      ],
